    "body": "Was your battery below 10%? Regarding your and the default configuration, the battery module is only shown, if it is below 10% (see: [Configuration/Battery](https://starship.rs/config/#battery)).\r\n\r\nWhat happens if add the following to your configuration?\r\n```toml\r\n[[battery.display]]\r\nthreshold = 100\r\nstyle     = \"bold green\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n",
