    "body": "What is your current battery module section of the configuration? Mine is:\r\n```toml\r\n[battery]\r\nfull_symbol        = \"🔋 \"\r\ncharging_symbol    = \"⚡️ \"\r\ndischarging_symbol = \"💀 \"\r\n\r\n[[battery.display]]\r\nthreshold = 10\r\nstyle     = \"bold red\"\r\n\r\n[[battery.display]]\r\nthreshold = 100\r\nstyle     = \"bold green\"\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
